    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d204">

                <pb facs="0263" n="203" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg203"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Gresham</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-05-09"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The ratifications of the treaty were exchanged. Japan agrees not to occupy
                    permanently Liaotung.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
